abstract: >
  GRIPS is a Pakistan-focused academic literature search platform for GIS,
  remote sensing, and Earth science research, aggregating and disambiguating
  results from OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar, CrossRef, arXiv, Unpaywall, and
  other sources.
